---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — nothing stored, files auto-deleted | ScamLens"
  description="ScamLens privacy: no storage by default, screenshots processed locally and deleted after scan, OTPs and card numbers redacted before analysis."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="display-section mt-4">What we see, what we keep (almost nothing)</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">Nothing is stored</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Your pasted text and uploaded screenshots stay in your browser during the scan.
          We don't write messages, images or results to a database. When you close or reset
          the page, your input is gone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">Files are auto-deleted</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Uploaded images exist only in memory for the duration of the scan and are
          discarded automatically afterwards. There is no gallery of user uploads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">Sensitive data is redacted first</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Before any analysis runs, patterns for OTPs, card numbers and phone numbers are
          replaced with masked characters (<code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">••••••</code>).
          The analysis only ever sees the redacted version — even if you accidentally paste an OTP,
          it never leaves readable form.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">What the analysis sees</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Only the redacted text. In this version, screenshot analysis also happens locally
          in your browser — the image itself is never transmitted to any server.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">Cookies &amp; advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          The checker shows at most one unobtrusive anchor ad; library pages show in-article ads.
          Ad partners may use cookies per their own policies — we never attach your input to them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="headline">What we ask of you</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-1 p-4 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink">
          Avoid pasting OTPs, PINs and passwords anyway. We redact them automatically — but the safest
          secret is one that was never shared.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 text-caption leading-relaxed text-ink-tertiary">
        Questions about this policy? Reach us via scamlens.in. Last updated August 2026.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
